  E5 rows whose PATCHABLE fields changed == exactly expected 8; list of changed fields per row ⊆ PATCHABLE; no non-patchable field differs on any row.
  E6 staged class tokens: every token in class_ids/informs_classes ∈ FROZEN; class_ids∩informs_classes=∅; every staged class_ids/informs_classes value a list of strings.
  E7 repair mapping: per changed row, live class_ids has exactly 2 frozen tokens; staged class_ids is a subset (possibly empty) of live class_ids; staged informs_classes (if any) ⊆ live class_ids; and staged class_ids ∪ informs_classes covers... hmm, for 6 SCC rows staged class_ids=[] with informs=[C0]; for 2 WCC rows staged class_ids=[AF-WCC-VAC-GEN] and informs=[AF-WCC-VAC-GEN]? Let me check T-515/T-528 after. The diff shows "after" for T-515? Need to check. Let me not over-constrain: require staged class_ids ⊆ live class_ids, staged informs_classes ⊆ live class_ids, and (staged class_ids ∪ staged informs_classes) non-empty and ⊆ live class_ids.
